<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>{% if Target.PrimaryField %}{{ Target.PrimaryField }} | {% elsif Target.Title and Target.Title != "Carrow Bend Water" %}{{ Target.Title }} | {% endif %}Carrow Bend Water — self-hosted CMS for water utilities</title>
<meta name="description" content="{% if Target.PublishedContent.summary %}{{ Target.PublishedContent.summary | strip_html | escape }}{% else %}Carrow Bend Water &amp; Sewer District (fictional): pay a bill, check service alerts, read water quality reports, start or stop service, and see rates — a local water utility website built as a self-hosted CMS for water utilities, a .NET CMS for a local water utility website.{% endif %}">
<style>
:root{--deep:#063a4a;--teal:#0b6b7f;--aqua:#1497b8;--mist:#e8f3f5;--amber:#ffba08;--red:#c0392b;--ink:#14232a;--paper:#f7fbfc;--line:#c9dde2}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);background:var(--paper);line-height:1.6}
a{color:var(--teal)}img{max-width:100%;display:block}h1,h2,h3{line-height:1.08;margin:0;color:var(--deep)}h1{font-size:clamp(2.3rem,5vw,4.2rem);letter-spacing:-.03em}h2{font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2.2rem)} .wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px}
.top{background:var(--deep);color:#dff3f7;font-size:.85rem}.top .wrap{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding-top:8px;padding-bottom:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}.fict{background:var(--amber);color:#111;padding:1px 7px;font-weight:800;border-radius:3px}
.alertbar{background:var(--amber);color:#1d1a00;padding:10px 0;font-weight:650}.alertbar a{color:#1d1a00}
.hdr{background:#fff;border-bottom:4px solid var(--aqua);position:sticky;top:0;z-index:20}.hdr .wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding-top:12px;padding-bottom:12px}.brand{text-decoration:none;color:var(--deep);font-weight:900;font-size:1.3rem;line-height:1}.brand span{color:var(--aqua)}.brand small{display:block;font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#56707a;margin-top:5px}
.nav{list-style:none;display:flex;gap:2px;margin:0 0 0 auto;padding:0;flex-wrap:wrap}.nav a{display:block;padding:9px 11px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--deep);font-weight:650;border-radius:6px}.nav a:hover{background:var(--mist)}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:var(--deep);color:#fff!important;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:750;border:2px solid var(--deep)} .btn.light{background:#fff;color:var(--deep)!important}.btn.amber{background:var(--amber);color:#111!important;border-color:var(--amber)}
.hero{background:linear-gradient(160deg,var(--deep),#075d75 60%,#0a7f99);color:#fff;padding:54px 0 42px}.hero h1{color:#fff}.hero .lede{color:#dff3f7;font-size:1.18rem;max-width:760px}
.status{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:14px;margin:26px 0}.stat{background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35);border-radius:12px;padding:16px}.stat b{font-size:1.55rem;display:block;color:#fff}.stat span{color:#cfeef5;font-size:.9rem}
.actions{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:14px;margin:-8px 0 8px}.action{background:#fff;border:2px solid var(--line);border-top:6px solid var(--aqua);border-radius:12px;padding:18px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink)}.action:hover{border-color:var(--aqua)}.action b{color:var(--deep);font-size:1.05rem}.action p{margin:6px 0 0;color:#526a73}
.sec{padding:48px 0}.sec.white{background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)} .kick{font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--teal);font-weight:800}.lede{font-size:1.08rem;max-width:780px;color:#3d5964}
.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:18px}.card.accent{border-top:6px solid var(--amber)} .card img{border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:12px}
.pill{display:inline-block;padding:2px 9px;border-radius:20px;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;background:var(--mist);color:var(--deep)} .pill.active{background:#ffe1de;color:#7a1710}.pill.scheduled{background:#fff0bf;color:#5c4300}.pill.resolved{background:#d9f2df;color:#145324}
.grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 350px;gap:26px;align-items:start}.prose h2{margin:.8em 0 .4em}
.tblwrap{overflow:auto}.tbl{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;background:#fff}.tbl td,.tbl th{border:1px solid var(--line);padding:11px 12px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top}
.phead{background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:42px 0 26px}.crumbs{list-style:none;display:flex;gap:8px;padding:0;margin:0 0 12px;font-size:.85rem}
.listrow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:150px 1fr 190px;gap:18px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:18px;margin-bottom:12px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink)}.listrow:hover{border-color:var(--aqua)}
input{font:inherit;padding:11px;border:2px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;width:100%}
.foot{background:var(--deep);color:#cfe3e8;padding:44px 0 24px}.foot a{color:#fff}.fcols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr 1fr;gap:22px}
@media(max-width:900px){.status,.actions,.cards,.grid2,.fcols,.listrow{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style></head><body>
<div class="top"><div class="wrap"><span><span class="fict">FICTIONAL EXAMPLE</span> Carrow Bend is not a real town and this district does not serve anyone.</span><span>Ossel River · Carrow Bend</span></div></div>
<div class="alertbar"><div class="wrap">⚠ Story alert: Main Street boil-water notice in effect for two blocks — <a href="{{ PathBase }}/alerts">see service alerts</a>. All other systems normal.</div></div>
<header class="hdr"><div class="wrap"><a class="brand" href="{{ PathBase }}/">CARROW BEND <span>WATER</span><small>Water &amp; Sewer District · Est. 1962 (story)</small></a><nav aria-label="Main"><ul class="nav">{%- assign menu=get_main_menu() -%}{% for mi in menu.MenuItems %}<li><a href="{{ mi.Url }}">{{ mi.Label }}</a></li>{% endfor %}</ul></nav></div></header>
<main>{% renderbody %}</main>
<footer class="foot"><div class="wrap"><h2 style="color:#fff">Water you can read about,<br>not just pay for.</h2><p>Carrow Bend Water &amp; Sewer District (fictional) · 1 Reservoir Lane, Carrow Bend · office@carrowbend.example (does not reach anyone) · Emergency (story): call the town number on your bill</p><div class="fcols"><div>Alerts, quality reports, rates, board meetings and conservation guides — published as structured content, server-rendered, working without JavaScript. No real payment, account or customer data is collected here.</div><div><b>CUSTOMERS</b><br><a href="{{ PathBase }}/pay-bill">Pay a bill</a><br><a href="{{ PathBase }}/start-stop-service">Start / stop service</a><br><a href="{{ PathBase }}/rates-and-fees">Rates &amp; fees</a><br><a href="{{ PathBase }}/report-a-problem">Report a problem</a></div><div><b>DISTRICT</b><br><a href="{{ PathBase }}/alerts">Service alerts</a><br><a href="{{ PathBase }}/quality">Water quality</a><br><a href="{{ PathBase }}/board-meetings">Board meetings</a><br><a href="{{ PathBase }}/accessibility">Accessibility</a> · <a href="{{ PathBase }}/search">Search</a></div></div><p style="font-size:.85rem;margin-top:24px">Fictional Raytha example. A self-hosted CMS for water utilities — server-rendered Liquid templates, no client app in the layout.</p></div></footer></body></html>
